<!doctype html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>{{appName}} – Password Reset Code</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #111; line-height: 1.6; }
      .card { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px; }
      .code { font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 6px; font-weight: 700; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1px dashed #9ca3af; display: inline-block; border-radius: 8px; }
      .muted { color: #6b7280; font-size: 12px; }
      .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; border:1px solid #111; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Password reset code</h2>
      <p>Hi {{username}},</p>
      <p>We received a request to reset the password for your {{appName}} account ({{email}}).</p>

      <p>Use the following verification code:</p>
      <p class="code">{{code}}</p>

      <p>This code is valid until <strong>{{expiresAtHuman}}</strong>.</p>

      <p class="muted">
        Request details: {{ip}} · {{ua}}
      </p>

      <p>If you didn’t request this, you can safely ignore this email — your password will remain unchanged.</p>

      <p>Need help? Visit <a class="btn" href="{{appUrl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">our site</a></p>

      <p>— The {{appName}} Team</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
